# Requirements

Parameters a0..a4 are constant levels of inputs c0..c4.

### H1: Zero input leaves the body still

WHEN all constant levels a0..a4 are 0 for the whole trial, THE system SHALL stay near the start pose.

```prediction
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [-0.1, 0.1]
label = "inside"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 0
a1 = 0
a2 = 0
a3 = 0
a4 = 0
```

Result (E1): hit. x=4.8e-5. c0=1 alone: no motion. c1=1 alone: heading +39 deg, x -0.23.

### H2: Inputs c2, c3, c4 each do something to the pose

WHEN only one of a2, a3, a4 is 1 and the rest are 0, THE system SHALL move or turn the body measurably, with at least one of x or heading changing.

```prediction
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "heading"
range = [-180, -5]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 0
a1 = 0
a2 = 1
a3 = 0
a4 = 0
```

Result (E2): P1 missed (heading -0.22). Constants on c2,c3,c4 give only a brief transient.

### H3: Oscillating drive on c0 produces sustained displacement

WHEN c0 is a 1 Hz sine of amplitude 1 and the other inputs are 0, THE system SHALL move the body so that x ends above 0.1 m.

```prediction
[[prediction]]
id = "P1"
measurement = "x"
range = [0.1, 2.0]
label = "new-combination"
[prediction.when]
a0 = 1
a1 = 0
a2 = 0
a3 = 0
a4 = 0
f = 1
```
